{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:53:42+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:53:42+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Skanska AB (publ)","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","country":"Sweden","city":"Stockholm","website":"https://group.skanska.com","employees":26363,"summary":"Skanska AB (publ) operates as a construction and project development company in the Nordics, Europe, and the United States. It operates through four segments: Construction, Residential Development, Commercial Property Development, and Investment Properties. The Construction segment builds social infrastructure, including schools, hospitals, healthcare, and judicial buildings; mass transit comprising rails, subways, and airports; highways, bridges, and tunnels; data centers and advanced tech manufacturing buildings/facilities; energy; defense-related buildings and infrastructure; offices, manufacturing, and other commercial buildings; and residential multifamily buildings. Its Residential Development segment develops and builds single and multifamily homes. The Commercial Property Development segment initiates, develops, leases, and divests in offices, life-science, and logistics and commercial warehouses, as well as residential rental properties. Its Investment Properties segment invests and manages office properties. The company was formerly known as Skånska Cementgjuteriet and changed its name to Skanska AB (publ) in December 1983. Skanska AB (publ) was founded in 1887 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Skanska AB (publ) opère en tant que société de construction et de développement de projets dans les pays nordiques, en Europe et aux États-Unis. Elle exerce ses activités dans quatre secteurs : la construction, le développement résidentiel, le développement de propriétés commerciales et les propriétés d’investissement. Le secteur de la construction construit des infrastructures sociales, y compris des écoles, des hôpitaux, des établissements de santé et des bâtiments judiciaires; les transports en commun comprennent les chemins de fer, les métros et les aéroports; les autoroutes, les ponts et les tunnels; les centres de données et les bâtiments / installations de fabrication de technologies de pointe; l'énergie; les bâtiments et infrastructures liés à la défense; les bureaux, la fabrication et autres bâtiments commerciaux; et les bâtiments multifamiliaux résidentiels."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":116936310784,"shares_outstanding":394567119,"trailing_pe":17.67209,"forward_pe":16.749702,"price_to_book":1.9021062,"ev_to_ebitda":13.42,"ev_to_revenue":0.67,"dividend_yield":0.0301,"payout_ratio":0.5319,"beta_yahoo":0.812},"targets":{"current_price":282.4,"mean":287.75,"median":298.5,"high":330.0,"low":240.0,"n_analysts":8,"reco_mean":2.0,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-05"],"eps_avg":4.62,"eps_low":4.62,"eps_high":4.62,"revenue_avg":46619000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-01","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.15262,"institutions_pct":0.40296,"institutions_float_pct":0.47554,"institutions_n":281,"institutions":[{"name":"McIlrath & Eck, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":4669,"value":1318525,"date":"2026-03-31","chg":1.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0123000005,"shares":4906836,"value":1385690456,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0128},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0081,"shares":3253976,"value":918922802,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0197},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0063,"shares":2524076,"value":712799046,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0121},{"name":"Fidelity Concord Street Trust-Fidelity International Index Fund","pct":0.0032,"shares":1294821,"value":365657442,"date":"202